{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1493165-what-is-your-character-s-relationship-with-there-sire","id":1493165,"title":"What is your character's relationship with there sire?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-16T10:15:44-07:00","id":1493165,"title":"What is your character's relationship with there sire?","content":"I'm sure that this has been been posted before and people get bored with it. I just like seeing how people go about it in there games.<br /> <br /> Myself I play a Brujah ancilla who was the result of an act of passion from his sire and he has a strained relationship with her and has some resentment to her being ripped from his mortal life and what he had to give up and getting the short temper when in life he was even tempered and resolves himself to make the best of a bad hand he was dealt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-16T16:42:06-07:00","id":1493186,"title":"","content":"I play Kiara, a Toredor violinist with an interest in researching family history of various families of the Gary and Chicago area who is the Childe of Alicia of Gary.<br /> <br /> Alicia found out that Modius was going to embrace her at his New Years Eve party and decided to do it herself so she could spare Kiara from the torture and abuse of her own sire. Kiara loves her sire and is trying to help Alicia find out about her pst. However Modius has learned that some Toreador has embraced what would be is own childe, but Kira claims that she ws embraced at a party and did not see who it ws (true in a way).<br /> <br /> Alicia and Kiara has a very amicable relationship and both wants to do something towards Modius so that Alicia can be free.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25995-ethryo","name":"Ethryo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-16T19:41:59-07:00","id":1493192,"title":"","content":"My character, Julian, is a Tremere cyberterrorist. He started out in Systems Security but was constantly hamstrung by his employers, so he decided to take them for what they're worth. A few hefty payouts and more than one trip to a non extradition Caribbean country later, and he found himself saddled with an offer he couldn't refuse. <br /> <br /> At first his Sire, the Regent, didn't appreciate what he could do, and treated him more as a go-fer. He chafed under this and more often than not obeyed to the spirit of the command, but not the letter. In one instance, when tasked with finding out who owned several bank accounts, he stole the contents of the accounts, Swatted the owner, and told his Sire to watch the 11 o clock news to find out who the owner was.<br /> <br /> There's a certain level of respect between them at this point. He is told the general goals of his Sire, and is given leeway to offer suggestions towards accomplishing them. That said, his Sire has insisted on broadening Julian's horizons, arguing his social skills left little to be desired. Julian, having finally proven himself to someone, is so far happily accepting tutelage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-16T19:55:15-07:00","id":1493195,"title":"","content":"My last VtM PC arranged to get his sire bloodhunted so he could diablerize him without getting into trouble... it wasn't a good relationship while it lasted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-16T21:45:39-07:00","id":1493196,"title":"","content":"My first couple of characters were distant or contentious but the real way to win is to suck up as much as possible and hope the ST doesn't start loathing you for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-16T22:40:27-07:00","id":1493199,"title":"","content":"Excellent. She freed her from being human, and taught her a Path of Enlightenment, basically freeing her from being human twice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 09-17-2022, 01:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-17T01:11:50-07:00","id":1493206,"title":"","content":"Samantha loomis,up and coming lasombra from botched, non concensusl spontaneous embrace. Her sire is actually an pc from another chronicle and She actually started out as a npc in that game.<br /> <br /> She seethes with hatred, rage and spite for him. He ruined her life and turned her into a monster. Furthermore she never recieved any support from him and was initially considered a bit of an embarrassment in the clan. Through carefully calculated savagery and get social instincts she's moved up the ladder to the point she's about to be adopted as an lasombra bishops childe, that relationship has potential. <br /> <br /> Its also had the knock on effect of making her unusually supportive and doting for a lasombra in terms of her childer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-17T15:25:30-07:00","id":1493219,"title":"","content":"Daniel Woloshyn. A 272 year old Banu Haqim from Prussia. Like most kindred his relationship with his sire is... complicated. On the one hand he does loves his sire, but on the other hand he resents her from taking him away from his family. It is comforting and painful that they went one to have happy lives without him. Couple that with being embraced as a twelve year old, just as his sire before him and he doesn't really know how to feel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-19T22:42:26-07:00","id":1493382,"title":"","content":"Edmund Ephraim White, 9th gen Ventrue, embraced in 1836 by the industrious but also rather gullible William Appleby, who saw potential in the sweet talking Mr. White who came from an upper middle class family in West Brompton, London - son of a newly rich merchant, Edmund never lacked anything other than the attention of his parents. Later at Eton Boarding School he soon realized his potentials as a conniver and rarely studied or applied himself to academia. Though he doesn't see himself as such, Edmund is a full blown sociopath, who revels in sadistic behaviour and in generally belittling others in order to make them serve his purposes. As a human he saw himself as superior to (almost) everyone else, and as a vampire he sees himself as almost a god. He loathes the vast amount of foreigners filling the streets of 19th century London, and at some point his feeding on immigrant women turned into sadistic and elaborate murders. When vampire hunters finally caught scent of him and had him cornered, Edmund's sire intervened to save his childe, but got instead killed himself. Edmund fled the scene and saved himself. The acting prince of London, Desmond Hastings, wanted to punish Edmund for his crimes, the breach of the masquerade and for the loss of a dear clan mate ... but as he couldn't afford the scandal in vampire society, Edmund was instead strategically placed in various coteries where Hastings deemed he could do as little harm as possible.<br /> <br /> The coterie he is presently in (the other players) have been told that he's there to make sure the Masquerade is upheld (they tend to blow up stuff) and that he's there as an advicer. Obviously, they don't trust him but as they have little choice, they put up with him for the time being. What horrors he's about to unleash, we shall see in the upcoming games ...<br /> <br /> V<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;They do say, Mrs. M, that verbal insults hurt more than physical pain. They are of course wrong, as you will soon discover when I stick this toasting fork into your head.&quot;<br /> <br /> --E. Blackadder","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24273-vincent","name":"Vincent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24273_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}